  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1801.05 National Emission Standards For Asbestos",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1801.05 National Emission Standards For Asbestos.\n\n(a) Under the authority of RSA 141-E:4, XVI(c), the owner or operator of a facility subject to this chapter shall comply with 40 CFR 61, subpart M, as in effect on July 1, 2023 except for the following provisions of 40 CFR:\n\n(1) 61.145(c)(1)(i);\n\n(2) 61.145(c)(1)(ii);\n\n(3) 61.145(c)(1)(iv);\n\n(4) 61.149(c)(2);\n\n(5) 61.150(a)(4);\n\n(6) 61.150(a)(5);\n\n(7) 61.150(b)(3);\n\n(8) 61.151 with respect to disposal sites not operated after July 9, 1981;\n\n(9) 61.151(c);\n\n(10) 61.152(b)(3);\n\n(11) 61.154(c);\n\n(12) 61.154(d);\n\n(13) 61.155(a); and\n\n(14) 61.157.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
